# Quotes (#74, #75). Reading: Admin/Sales/Designer/Operator; writing: Admin/Sales. Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@customerId = 0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### List all quotes (unpaged array; filters: customerId, status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes?status=Sent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Paged list: search by customer name or note, status filter, sorting, per-status counts (statusCounts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes/paged?q=novak&status=Sent&page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=grossTotal&sortDir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Paged list of one customer's quotes, newest first (default order)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes/paged?customerId={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
